{"id":"1003ce3e4d1c6eaa","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md","title":"Gödel Set Undecidable","display":"thm-godel-set-undecidable — Gödel Set Undecidable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-godel-set-undecidable","aliases":["92-thm-godel-set-undecidable"],"display":"thm-godel-set-undecidable — Gödel Set Undecidable","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-set]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent]]","[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]"],"source":"第 VII 章 pp. 86–89（PDF 103–106）；不可判定性为本地推论","source_status":"原书表示定理的本地可计算论推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-godel-set-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-godel-set-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-set-undecidable — Gödel Set Undecidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"afb86879a743e8fe\" href=\"?note=afb86879a743e8fe\" title=\"92-thm-k-g-equivalent\">92-thm-k-g-equivalent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8665bbc504ca9fb6\" href=\"?note=8665bbc504ca9fb6\" title=\"92-thm-halting-undecidable\">92-thm-halting-undecidable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 pp. 86–89（PDF 103–106）；不可判定性为本地推论"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书表示定理的本地可计算论推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span> (Gödel set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d8d33d47202e6d60\" href=\"?note=d8d33d47202e6d60\" title=\"92-df-godel-set\">92-df-godel-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> (effective proof-system condition)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength condition)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}set\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}set\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)\\)</span> : Gödel集不可判定</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>是可证句子的Gödel数集</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>可判定，则可判定任意句子是否可证</li>\n<li>对有效且足够强的相容<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>可判定，就能有效构造与本质不完备性冲突的判定过程</li>\n<li>这是本质不完备性在定理码集合上的可判定性后果；从单个独立句的存在到统一不可判定性仍使用有效性与足够强度</li>\n<li>在同样的充分条件下，可另证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\\leq_m K\">\\(K_G\\leq_m K\\)</span>且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\leq_m K_G\">\\(K\\leq_m K_G\\)</span>；两条归约不是本断言仅凭名称自动包含的内容</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>从停机集到定理码集合的多一归约给出统一不可判定性；仅由存在一个未判定句，不足以排除定理集合可判定。使用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"afb86879a743e8fe\" href=\"?note=afb86879a743e8fe\" title=\"92-thm-k-g-equivalent\">92-thm-k-g-equivalent</a>的表示归约与停机不可判定性。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 pp. 86–89（PDF 103–106）；不可判定性为本地推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-k-g-equivalent","status":"resolved","id":"afb86879a743e8fe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-halting-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"8665bbc504ca9fb6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-set","status":"resolved","id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K_G$ (Gödel set, see [[92-df-godel-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (external consistency predicate, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-k-g-equivalent","status":"resolved","id":"afb86879a743e8fe","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"从停机集到定理码集合的多一归约给出统一不可判定性；仅由存在一个未判定句，不足以排除定理集合可判定。使用[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent]]的表示归约与停机不可判定性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}set\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\n\\Longrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K_G)","display":false},{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"K_G","display":false},{"tex":"K_G\\leq_m K","display":false},{"tex":"K\\leq_m K_G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2354,"backlinks":[{"id":"f2940633bae35b52","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"证明采用 [[92-thm-tarski-undefinability]] 的标准模型版本：若码集 c.e.，其枚举程序的“某个有限阶段输出 n”可写成存在一个有限计算记录的算术条件；存在量化得到 Σ₁ 的 n 成员公式。这是本文 CE 计算模型所用的标准算术正常形事实，见 [[92-df-ce-set]] 的背景约定。对所有句码，它便定义完整标准真值，与 Tarski 冲突。此证明不把只适用于固定 G 定理集合的 [[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable]] 擅自实例化为真算术。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable]]"}],"outgoing":["d8d33d47202e6d60","b090f61b9f3ec664","c7befd96bd551ade","360e00ddf38f0f16","468d35690d25ee42","975b3aa9a1e08797","afb86879a743e8fe","8665bbc504ca9fb6","0a1ba58f66cc8d4e"]}